OL,3,AJaguar Land Rover to cut 4,000 jobs
OL,4,Aover next two years
OL,5,
OL,6,FJaguar Land Rover (JLR) is to cut 4,000
OL,7,Fjobs as the carmaker struggles with
OL,8,FChinese competition, US tariffs, and
OL,9,Fthe transition to electric vehicles.
OL,11,FThe cuts will happen over the next two
OL,12,Fyears and will mostly affect the head
OL,13,Foffice, which is based in the UK.
OL,15,FJLR's long-term issues were made worse
OL,16,Fafter a cyber-attack last year caused
OL,17,Fthe firm, which employs 43,000 people
OL,18,Fglobally, to shut down production for
OL,19,Fmore than a month.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/40
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
