OL,3,AOfficers injured and vehicles damaged
OL,4,Ain Portsmouth small boats protest,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FA small number of officers were injured
OL,8,Fand some vehicles damaged during a
OL,9,Fprotest against small boat crossings in
OL,10,FPortsmouth last night, police say
OL,12,FHundreds blocked roads in the city
OL,13,Fafter 140 migrants were brought to
OL,14,Fshore - shadow home secretary Chris
OL,15,FPhilp says people are "genuinely angry
OL,16,Fat the government's failure to stop the
OL,17,Fboats"
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/40
