OL,3,AOfficers injured and vehicles damaged
OL,4,Ain Portsmouth small boats protest,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne protester in Portsmouth tells the
OL,8,FBBC people are "absolutely fed up" with
OL,9,Fsmall boat arrivals, but one local says
OL,10,Fsome protesters' views made her
OL,11,F"genuinely unsettled"
OL,13,FA total of 625 migrants were brought to
OL,14,Fshore in Dover and Portsmouth
OL,15,Fyesterday, according to Home Office
OL,16,Ffigures - although overall, the number
OL,17,Fis down in 2026
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
